  --format FORMAT       input format. (yson string), one of "yson", "json", "yamr", "dsv",
                        "yamred_dsv", "schemaful_dsv" with modifications. See also:
                        https://ytsaurus.tech/docs/en/user-guide/storage/formats
  --table-writer TABLE_WRITER
                        structured table-writer in yson format
  --compressed          expect stream to contain compressed file data. Warning! This option
                        disables retries. Data is passed directly to proxy without recompression.
  --no-compression      disable compression

Rewrite table by default. For append mode specify <append=true> before path.
